{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Cruise the streets in style.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join your friends in Adrenaline: Online, a chill racing game where you build your custom rides how you want, to represent who you are. Explore the corners of the open-world environment on your own or online with your crew.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466260/extras/ADRENALINE_KeyArt_LIB_HERO_PNG__4_.png?t=1742927416\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the city with your friends</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cruise around the island alone or with others in online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your new ride in a car meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden secrets in the deepest corners of town.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make money your way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start impromptu races and challenge the other players where you can risk it all for cash or fame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Taxis or Pizza Co. and make a quick buck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try something more relaxing like fishing for goods or dumpster diving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Customize Customize</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose individual parts to change the look and performance of your ride.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new styles and outfits to showcase who YOU are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More player customizable areas to come soon.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466260?t=1742927416","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466260?t=1742927416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466260/7e0283b0fb783825ec5e16a595c71b45ab565235/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742927416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466260/7e0283b0fb783825ec5e16a595c71b45ab565235/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742927416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Cruise the streets in style.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join your friends in Adrenaline: Online, a chill racing game where you build your custom rides how you want, to represent who you are. Explore the corners of the open-world environment on your own or online with your crew.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466260/extras/ADRENALINE_KeyArt_LIB_HERO_PNG__4_.png?t=1742927416\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the city with your friends</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cruise around the island alone or with others in online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your new ride in a car meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden secrets in the deepest corners of town.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make money your way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start impromptu races and challenge the other players where you can risk it all for cash or fame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Taxis or Pizza Co. and make a quick buck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try something more relaxing like fishing for goods or dumpster diving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Customize Customize</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose individual parts to change the look and performance of your ride.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new styles and outfits to showcase who YOU are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More player customizable areas to come soon.</p></li></ul>","developers":["GoldShark Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466260/a691b61ecfcb43ef5d2071aaaa9e1980d63afe3d/header.jpg?t=1742927416","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":false,"id":257117414,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117414/movie480.mp4?t=1742612863","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117414/movie_max.mp4?t=1742612863"},"name":"Look Both Ways Before Crossing the Road","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117414/77e78943b4384342cf818e48d4277c0233c1bb68/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742612863","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117414/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742612863","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117414/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742612863"}}],"name":"Adrenaline: Online","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or newer.<br></li><l